      <activity id="b4f0cb22-2cc2-51eb-a961-0566fc0842a6" activityNameId="2d491194-accf-576f-815d-229389d7523e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Preservative treatment, logs, pressure vessel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Preservative treatment, logs, pressure vessel
For wood in permanent soil contact 6-12 kg/m3 of Cr-containing, 3-4 kg/m3 of Cr-free preservative or 115 kg/m3 creosote is needed. For weather exposed wood 4-7.5 of Cr-containing or 2-3 kg/m3 of Cr-free preservative is required.;
Synonyms: mineralize, creosote; 
UUID: 718d8a1b-0b12-3b20-bb7a-5fbdca6f29e3
Impregnation process only. No wood nor preservative included. No transports included. No data on waste water available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Pressure vessel treatment
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_718d8a1b-0b12-3b20-bb7a-5fbdca6f29e3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
